<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Communications.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Michael Karfopoulos upgraded Ascend Communications Inc to long-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said kept the short-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- said raised the fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $1.69 a share from $1.55 a share and the fiscal 1998 estimate to $2.10 a share from $2.07 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term price target is $63 a share.</p>
<p>-- Ascend gained 3-1/8 to 53.</p>
</text>
